  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity INFRACO Africa Capital is a component of InfraCo Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,537,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Telecommunications, Energy generation, renewable sources - multiple technologies, Road transport, Transport policy and administrative management, Energy generation, non-renewable sources, unspecified, Water supply and sanitation - large systems, Waste management/disposal, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation.</narrative>
